id: pm-esbt
title: "docs-skills-gate: validate anchor fragments in relative links"
description: "2026-07-04 docs review: scripts/release/docs-skills-gate.mjs splits links on [?#], so FILE.md#heading links only check file existence. All 12 current anchor links verified manually — nothing broken — but future dead anchors are ungated. Extend the gate to slugify headings in the target file and assert the fragment exists. Also break the wall-of-text paragraphs (EXTENSIONS.md line 89 ~4600 chars, line 114; COMMANDS.md lines 612, 627) into bullets while touching docs."
