acceptance_criteria: docs-skills-gate fails on relative links whose anchor fragment does not exist in the target document; gate green on current docs.
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Validated rendered Markdown heading fragments using maintained parsing and GitHub slug rules, and restructured the four documented long paragraphs. HTML parsing now handles unquoted attributes and angle brackets inside quoted values without regex stripping."
expected_result: "Dead anchors fail the mandatory gate while valid formatted, duplicate, Unicode, entity, code and custom anchors resolve."
actual_result: "Negative-control tests and the full docs gate pass; the extension guide remains within its unchanged 450-line limit. Additional HTML attribute, comment, and rendered-text negative controls pass."
